meta {
  name: 03. Change Email (Protected)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/email
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "new-email@doratou.local"
  }
}

docs {
  **Method:** `PATCH`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/users/me/email`
  **Auth:** Required

  ## Description

  Updates the authenticated user's email address after successful OTP verification.

  ## Request

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `email` | `string` | Yes | Valid email address verified via OTP |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Default User",
      "friend_code": "DR-7K9M2X8Q4P6R",
      "email": "new-email@doratou.local",
      "phone": "+989123456789",
      "is_email_verified": true,
      "is_phone_verified": false,
      "avatar_attachment_id": null,
      "system_role": "USER",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "wallet": 0,
      "telegram_chat_id": null,
      "telegram_user_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid email format
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Email not verified via OTP or account deactivated
  * `409 Conflict` — Email already registered by another user
}
